+<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">companion-part</ansi>
+
+Ends your travels with a bonded companion for good. They keep what they are
+carrying, walk away, and do not come back on their own.
+
+Nothing your companion says or decides can end the bond by itself. Either
+they ask to part ways and you confirm here, or you use this command twice
+within a minute.
+
+<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Usage ━━━</ansi>
+
+  <ansi fg="command">companion-part</ansi>    Part ways (asks once for confirmation).
+
+Their memories are kept. An administrator can bring them back with
+<ansi fg="command">aicompanion grant</ansi>.
